We are happy to announce the final release of Arch Legends!
We want to thank the community and their feedback!

[previewyoutube=zTWK1TO_9J4;full][/previewyoutube]


[list]
[*] Create your character and become a legend;
[*] You can customize and combine various types of skills by building unique characters;
[*] Summon different types of allies to help on your adventure;
[*] Forge various types of equipment providing improved stats for your character;
[/list]

[previewyoutube=ivP7LcYms38;full][/previewyoutube]

[list]
[*] Complete different types of objectives and continue progressing in your adventures;
[*] Use the black market to trade material items to help build your own equipment like weapons and armor;
[*] Join a guild and get rewards on your missions that will help you on your journey;
[*] Receive the benefit of the season pass while evolving your character;
[*] Challenge powerful enemies and receive valuable rewards;
[/list]

[previewyoutube=UNsz5qVeJeg;full][/previewyoutube]

What to expect from the game in the future? Players will be challenging themselves and always finding new objectives through updates of future new content that will extend as the seasons pass every 3 months... in addition to, of course, constant corrections and improvements!

